  "description": "The CLASH ESSENTIAL is striking with its immaculate white frame and all-black components.\n• FOX take care of the suspension with a 38 Float Performance fork. The super sensitive Float Evol spring and Grip hydraulic cartridge allows compression adjustment in three distinct positions. The FOX Float X Performance shock benefits from large air volume. It is linear and provides good ground feel thanks to a coil spring.\n• SHIMANO SLX 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs offer a clear and powerful feel.\n• The DT SWISS E 593 rims and their wide profile are ideal for aggressive riders. Combined with reinforced hubs they are perfect for the CLASH.\n• The SHIMANO SLX 12-speed drivetrain has efficient climbing capabilities. With wide 10-51 gearing, it’s perfect for rides with a lot of positive elevation gain.",
